      q4ActiveDyadicScaledNormalizedDerivativePowerDualProductField,
      q4PowerDualTest] using hout i hi)
        (by
          intro i hi
          simpa only [G,
      q4ActiveDyadicScaledNormalizedDerivativeSchwartzAnalysisField_eq,
